  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89168943e6e72e14",
      "translationZh": "我之前用的是 Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B + vscode 的 cline 插件，开满 256k 上下文，但光是让它“给我写个输出 print(\"hello\") 的 python 脚本”，它就要吃掉 100k 上下文，所以升级到 Qwen 3.8 27B 时，我就换成了 pi.dev。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85445a2b79623587",
      "translationZh": "我想弄明白什么设置最好……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe09c85b16324aeb",
      "translationZh": "目前我在用 llama.cpp，上下文设为 64k（直接照抄了 ninfer 的设置，但 llama-bench 显示好像能容纳大约 90k？？？？）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "413cfa69bc6d8920",
      "translationZh": "我没有用缓存量化，模型用的是 UD-Q4_K_XL 量化，因为网上一些人建议说，想提高质量，不用立刻换成 Q5，光是从 M 换成 XL 版本就有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4102fee8f5ec63c",
      "translationZh": "我还看到有人说，这基本上就是你能用的最低设置了：--cache-type-k q8_0 --cache-type-v q4_0，因为 k 用 4 位会变得很差，而 v 用 4 位就没那么糟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9554b3434cf4fff1",
      "translationZh": "我注意到，在 pi 里达到上下文上限不是什么大问题，pi 似乎处理得挺好，自动压缩时会有一段比较长的延迟，但之后它就像什么都没发生一样继续，完成任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a08ff09809029f66",
      "translationZh": "不过，我目前这套设置的速度有点慢。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38969d221201a7f1",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止，我一直没用过缓存量化，因为我不想影响当前任务的效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1c071581e62c512",
      "translationZh": "我有点不知道该怎么办了……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5d6b93ddee10630",
      "translationZh": "我可能会让 pi 做一些调研，并在我自己的硬件上做一些基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
